  "title": "Crescent Capital Appointed by U.K. Pension Fund Nest for £450 Million U.S. Direct Lending Mandate",
  "summary": "Crescent Capital Group LP, one of the leading alternative credit investment firms, announced today that it has been appointed by Nest, the largest U.K. workplace pension scheme by number of members, to manage a new open-ended U.S. direct lending mandate.",
